WEBVTT

00:01.290 --> 00:02.870
<b>Eiji is out of the hospital.</b>

00:03.250 --> 00:03.920
<b>Huh?</b>

00:04.330 --> 00:06.960
<b>I was honestly worried for a second,</b>

00:07.040 --> 00:09.340
<b>but you're back to your usual self.</b>

00:09.420 --> 00:11.590
<b>So I'm grateful to Eiji.</b>

00:12.420 --> 00:14.010
<b>He's a true hero.</b>

00:15.890 --> 00:18.260
<b><i>Why did Eiji save me?</i></b>

00:21.230 --> 00:22.100
<b><i>Why?</i></b>

00:30.070 --> 00:32.320
<b>It's okay, Hitori.</b>

00:33.950 --> 00:34.820
<b>Migi…</b>

00:35.780 --> 00:36.620
<b>Migi…</b>

00:36.700 --> 00:37.620
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:37.700 --> 00:39.200
<b>Does your heart hurt?</b>

00:53.760 --> 00:54.470
<b>Oh.</b>

01:01.890 --> 01:03.350
<b>Uh, umm…</b>

01:03.810 --> 01:04.600
<b>Well…</b>

01:04.940 --> 01:06.060
<b>I- I'm…</b>

01:06.520 --> 01:08.980
<b>I'm a girl from Eiji's school.</b>

01:09.060 --> 01:10.520
<b>I wanted to visit him.</b>

01:11.020 --> 01:13.990
<b>Eiji is currently
unable to receive guests.</b>

01:14.400 --> 01:15.740
<b>Please leave.</b>

01:16.280 --> 01:17.070
<b>Mom.</b>

01:20.080 --> 01:21.030
<b>Come in.</b>

01:21.910 --> 01:22.580
<b>Oh.</b>

03:00.880 --> 03:01.720
<b>Mom.</b>

03:01.800 --> 03:04.050
<b>Could you leave for a second?</b>

03:06.520 --> 03:08.520
<b>Call me right away if you need me.</b>

03:15.690 --> 03:17.690
<b>Keep your voice low for now, okay?</b>

03:17.780 --> 03:18.440
<b>Uh,</b>

03:19.190 --> 03:20.820
<b>I heard you got hurt.</b>

03:21.150 --> 03:21.910
<b>Are you okay?</b>

03:22.410 --> 03:23.320
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:23.410 --> 03:25.620
<b>I shouldn't have any lasting effects.</b>

03:27.160 --> 03:27.870
<b>Hey.</b>

03:27.950 --> 03:29.000
<b>Why did you…</b>

03:29.500 --> 03:31.210
<b>Save Hitori?</b>

03:34.590 --> 03:36.630
<b>I wasn't helping him.</b>

03:37.880 --> 03:38.880
<b>I just…</b>

03:39.630 --> 03:41.880
<b>wanted to atone for my sins.</b>

03:42.840 --> 03:44.050
<b>Atone?</b>

03:45.010 --> 03:45.970
<b>I'm…</b>

03:47.260 --> 03:48.270
<b>a sinner.</b>

03:52.020 --> 03:52.770
<b>Mom!</b>

03:52.850 --> 03:56.190
<b>Could you buy me some
sourdough bread from Descartes?</b>

04:00.400 --> 04:02.400
<b>I want to show you something.</b>

04:04.910 --> 04:06.330
<b><i>Is this…</i></b>

04:06.830 --> 04:09.790
<b><i>the Origon Village diorama</i>
<i>that Dali talked about?</i></b>

04:10.080 --> 04:13.370
<b>I honestly never really understood</b>

04:13.460 --> 04:16.130
<b>why my mom was
making something like this, but…</b>

04:16.210 --> 04:17.540
<b>I finally get it.</b>

04:19.210 --> 04:21.630
<b>She's been surveilling Origon Village</b>

04:21.720 --> 04:23.880
<b>to make sure
my secret was kept safe.</b>

04:24.840 --> 04:25.760
<b>Your secret?</b>

04:26.720 --> 04:28.470
<b>On Christmas Eve when I was five…</b>

04:29.220 --> 04:32.770
<b>I saw a woman in the window of my room</b>

04:32.850 --> 04:34.190
<b>and I pushed her down.</b>

04:36.480 --> 04:40.860
<b>And my mom made me believe
I'd just seen a ghost.</b>

04:40.940 --> 04:44.610
<b>She told me that there was
no one like that in Origon Village.</b>

04:45.280 --> 04:47.820
<b>But… There was.</b>

04:50.120 --> 04:52.450
<b><i>There's a doll house in my sister's room.</i></b>

04:52.540 --> 04:53.710
<b><i>And all the dolls inside of it</i></b>

04:54.290 --> 04:57.250
<b><i>are actually people who</i>
<i>used to live in Origon Village.</i></b>

04:57.330 --> 04:59.800
<b><i>That's where I found her.</i></b>

05:00.590 --> 05:02.880
<b>I suppose my mother thought</b>

05:02.970 --> 05:06.800
<b>that the woman I had pushed down
was now hiding somewhere in the village,</b>

05:06.890 --> 05:09.180
<b>and was waiting for
a chance to get revenge.</b>

05:09.850 --> 05:14.100
<b>Or maybe someone else knew who she was.</b>

05:14.180 --> 05:15.140
<b>And my mother suspects</b>

05:15.770 --> 05:21.070
<b>that someone knows my secret
and tried to kill me because of it.</b>

05:21.530 --> 05:22.690
<b>And now…</b>

05:22.780 --> 05:25.200
<b>The arrow is pointing to…</b>

05:34.120 --> 05:35.830
<b>Hitori is in danger.</b>

05:35.910 --> 05:38.250
<b>You have to let him know.</b>

05:38.330 --> 05:40.500
<b>Why me?</b>

05:41.340 --> 05:42.550
<b>Because you…</b>

05:42.630 --> 05:43.920
<b>like him, don't you?</b>

05:45.300 --> 05:45.970
<b>Huh?</b>

05:48.550 --> 05:49.760
<b>I'm…</b>

05:49.850 --> 05:51.510
<b>dating Eiji.</b>

05:54.180 --> 05:56.230
<b>I could easily tell.</b>

06:01.230 --> 06:02.190
<b><i>Dali…</i></b>

06:05.240 --> 06:08.410
<b>Are you playing house up here?</b>

06:08.910 --> 06:12.530
<b>They were sold out of
the sourdough bread you wanted.</b>

06:13.330 --> 06:14.830
<b>So instead</b>

06:15.330 --> 06:17.790
<b>I got a rock-hard…</b>

06:18.080 --> 06:20.750
<b>Stonebaked baguette.</b>

06:29.550 --> 06:30.340
<b>Run!</b>

06:39.730 --> 06:41.980
<b>Now that you have seen it</b>

06:42.360 --> 06:44.270
<b>I can't let you go.</b>

06:48.700 --> 06:51.700
<b>You!</b>

06:52.820 --> 06:55.620
<b><i>I have to tell Dali,</i>
<i>or he'll end up like Micchan.</i></b>

06:59.210 --> 07:01.630
<b>I won't let you get away.</b>

07:01.710 --> 07:04.840
<b>Hitori Sonoyama.</b>

07:24.310 --> 07:25.360
<b>Karen.</b>

07:25.980 --> 07:27.610
<b>What is it, Mom?</b>

07:27.990 --> 07:30.070
<b>I'm busy playing right now.</b>

07:36.540 --> 07:37.950
<b>Open the door.</b>

07:40.040 --> 07:42.330
<b>Open the doo--</b>

07:47.630 --> 07:48.510
<b><i>Oh no.</i></b>

07:57.310 --> 07:59.520
<b>Don't interrupt me when I'm playing!</b>

08:00.980 --> 08:04.520
<b>I'm having tea
with everyone, don't you see?</b>

08:07.400 --> 08:08.860
<b>A bread this hard</b>

08:08.940 --> 08:10.990
<b>doesn't go well with rose tea.</b>

08:12.110 --> 08:13.200
<b>You're right.</b>

08:20.950 --> 08:22.040
<b>Thank you.</b>

08:22.460 --> 08:23.580
<b>It's fine.</b>

08:25.080 --> 08:26.790
<b>That woman</b>

08:26.880 --> 08:28.550
<b>is not my mother.</b>

08:31.010 --> 08:32.670
<b>My brother and I</b>

08:32.760 --> 08:35.220
<b>wasn't born by her.</b>

08:35.800 --> 08:36.800
<b>We're just</b>

08:36.890 --> 08:40.430
<b>pretending to be one happy Ichijo family.</b>

08:42.270 --> 08:43.890
<b>But it's fake.</b>

08:44.650 --> 08:47.440
<b>My real family</b>

08:47.520 --> 08:48.610
<b>is here.</b>

09:06.500 --> 09:09.670
<b>Kill, kill, kill…</b>

09:11.550 --> 09:15.300
<b>Kill, kill, kill…</b>

09:23.180 --> 09:26.350
<b>How can we ever thank Eiji enough?</b>

09:26.900 --> 09:30.190
<b>Imagining what would've
happened if he hadn't been there…</b>

09:31.650 --> 09:32.820
<b>Oh, no.</b>

09:32.900 --> 09:36.660
<b>He only did what
any son of a doctor would do.</b>

09:36.740 --> 09:38.410
<b>How is Hitori?</b>

09:38.700 --> 09:41.620
<b>He's been sleeping ever since it happened.</b>

09:41.700 --> 09:44.710
<b>It seems to have taken
quite a toll on his mental health.</b>

09:45.750 --> 09:48.750
<b>Ever since, you say?</b>

09:48.830 --> 09:50.460
<b>-Yes.
-Yeah.</b>

09:50.540 --> 09:52.380
<b>Ever since…</b>

09:56.180 --> 09:57.510
<b>Oh?</b>

09:57.590 --> 09:59.300
<b>What is the matter?</b>

10:08.230 --> 10:09.810
<b><i>Not… her mom?</i></b>

10:10.650 --> 10:13.030
<b><i>Then who is that woman?</i></b>

10:13.110 --> 10:14.400
<b><i>And who is Eiji?</i></b>

10:15.190 --> 10:15.990
<b><i>Ah.</i></b>

10:16.070 --> 10:17.150
<b><i>Dali is in danger.</i></b>

10:17.780 --> 10:20.200
<b>I have to get out of here
before she finds me.</b>

10:21.280 --> 10:22.950
<b>You should run.</b>

10:23.040 --> 10:24.200
<b>Leave Origon Village.</b>

10:40.800 --> 10:42.260
<b><i>They're asleep.</i></b>

10:43.100 --> 10:46.270
<b><i>But it's… The middle of the day?</i></b>

10:48.770 --> 10:49.810
<b><i>Something's off.</i></b>

10:50.600 --> 10:54.020
<b><i>I have an uneasy feeling in my chest.</i></b>

11:01.740 --> 11:02.660
<b>Dali!</b>

11:02.740 --> 11:04.870
<b>What happened? Who did this to you?</b>

11:05.910 --> 11:06.790
<b>Migi…</b>

11:07.250 --> 11:08.710
<b>Why did you come?</b>

11:09.500 --> 11:10.210
<b>Huh?</b>

11:17.380 --> 11:20.180
<b>I would never have
expected for Hitori Sonoyama</b>

11:20.260 --> 11:22.930
<b>to be one person played by two people.</b>

11:24.050 --> 11:26.470
<b>So you are Metry's sons.</b>

11:26.560 --> 11:28.850
<b>Where is she hiding?</b>

11:29.230 --> 11:31.940
<b>Your son pushed her and killed her!</b>

11:32.600 --> 11:33.310
<b>Migi?</b>

11:33.650 --> 11:34.900
<b>How do you know--</b>

11:34.980 --> 11:36.650
<b>Eiji told me himself.</b>

11:36.980 --> 11:38.240
<b>She's dead?</b>

11:39.240 --> 11:40.320
<b>Dead?</b>

11:41.030 --> 11:42.320
<b>That's right.</b>

11:42.410 --> 11:43.870
<b>She's dead.</b>

11:47.490 --> 11:49.290
<b>What are you laughing at, woman!</b>

11:50.750 --> 11:52.750
<b>Finally</b>

11:52.830 --> 11:55.920
<b>you two get to see your precious mother.</b>

12:03.340 --> 12:04.720
<b>Go ahead and kill us.</b>

12:05.510 --> 12:07.680
<b>The Sonoyamas will not keep quiet about it.</b>

12:08.180 --> 12:10.310
<b>No matter how well you hide us,</b>

12:10.390 --> 12:11.690
<b>you will leave a trace.</b>

12:13.850 --> 12:15.860
<b>It's a possibility.</b>

12:15.940 --> 12:17.820
<b>Well then, how about this?</b>

12:18.570 --> 12:21.780
<b>I will kill only one of you two.</b>

12:22.610 --> 12:26.030
<b>Then no matter which one of you dies,
the old couple won't care.</b>

12:26.660 --> 12:28.830
<b>Because on the outside, Hitori is</b>

12:28.910 --> 12:31.960
<b>only one person.</b>

12:32.620 --> 12:35.170
<b>Now, which one of you should I kill?</b>

12:35.250 --> 12:38.500
<b>It's a hard question. You look the same.</b>

12:38.590 --> 12:41.470
<b>Tell me who of you
should be the one to die.</b>

12:41.800 --> 12:43.550
<b>What? No way!</b>

12:44.220 --> 12:45.800
<b>He has a short temper.</b>

12:45.890 --> 12:46.600
<b>Huh?</b>

12:46.890 --> 12:48.560
<b>He's not smart either.</b>

12:48.640 --> 12:50.390
<b>He eats like a pig</b>

12:50.470 --> 12:52.020
<b>and forgets things easily,</b>

12:52.100 --> 12:52.940
<b>Dali?</b>

12:53.270 --> 12:54.140
<b>Oh.</b>

12:54.230 --> 12:56.650
<b>So the one on the right
is the most lacking.</b>

12:57.190 --> 12:59.020
<b>He never does as he'd told,</b>

12:59.110 --> 13:00.900
<b>and gets fooled easily.</b>

13:01.150 --> 13:04.780
<b>He's going to cause a lot of
trouble for the Sonoyamas, isn't he?</b>

13:05.160 --> 13:06.240
<b>Dali…</b>

13:06.320 --> 13:07.370
<b>You…</b>

13:07.450 --> 13:08.410
<b>Yes.</b>

13:08.490 --> 13:10.120
<b>So the one who should die</b>

13:11.620 --> 13:12.450
<b>is me.</b>

13:15.420 --> 13:17.500
<b>Migi might be an idiot…</b>

13:18.210 --> 13:19.670
<b>but without him</b>

13:20.500 --> 13:21.880
<b>I couldn't go on.</b>

13:22.380 --> 13:23.840
<b>But he'll</b>

13:24.680 --> 13:27.390
<b>forget all about revenge and about me.</b>

13:29.560 --> 13:30.850
<b>He'll live on.</b>

13:31.180 --> 13:33.520
<b>An earnest decision, I see.</b>

13:34.770 --> 13:35.520
<b>Wait.</b>

13:36.650 --> 13:38.980
<b>The scarf suits you.</b>

13:39.060 --> 13:40.110
<b>Stop it.</b>

13:42.780 --> 13:44.900
<b>Dali!</b>

13:45.650 --> 13:46.450
<b>…Gi.</b>

13:46.910 --> 13:47.820
<b>Remember…</b>

13:48.620 --> 13:49.490
<b>to eat…</b>

13:49.950 --> 13:50.780
<b>enough…</b>

13:51.950 --> 13:52.870
<b>for the both</b>

13:53.370 --> 13:54.450
<b>of us.</b>

13:59.920 --> 14:01.800
<b><i>I can't see Migi any longer.</i></b>

14:05.050 --> 14:06.340
<b><i>Is this…</i></b>

14:08.510 --> 14:09.970
<b><i>My memories.</i></b>

14:10.550 --> 14:13.020
<b><i>Our dusty home…</i></b>

14:16.890 --> 14:17.480
<b>Huh?</b>

14:19.400 --> 14:22.400
<b>Even if you can't see it,
dust will accumulate.</b>

14:23.030 --> 14:25.610
<b>And the one who will
clean every nook and cranny</b>

14:26.360 --> 14:28.070
<b>is the housekeeper!</b>

14:28.410 --> 14:30.490
<b>It is my job.</b>

14:31.910 --> 14:34.950
<b>Even if you can't see it,
dust will accumulate.</b>

14:35.700 --> 14:38.170
<b>And the one who will
clean every nook and cranny</b>

14:38.960 --> 14:40.630
<b>is the housekeeper!</b>

14:41.000 --> 14:42.750
<b>It is my job.</b>

14:43.960 --> 14:45.420
<b>Long time no see.</b>

14:45.510 --> 14:47.970
<b>And nice to meet you, Double Hitori.</b>

14:48.470 --> 14:50.470
<b>But you died in the attic…</b>

14:51.180 --> 14:53.350
<b>At that time, the Mrs. caught me</b>

14:53.430 --> 14:55.890
<b>and almost buried me alive.</b>

14:55.970 --> 14:58.480
<b><i>But little Karen saved me.</i></b>

14:58.560 --> 15:03.150
<b><i>And after that I visited the people</i>
<i>who had been chased out of Origon Village,</i></b>

15:03.230 --> 15:06.030
<b><i>And I met Karen's birth mother.</i></b>

15:07.440 --> 15:08.490
<b>And then</b>

15:09.110 --> 15:12.950
<b>I found out that
the Mrs. cannot bear children.</b>

15:17.330 --> 15:20.290
<b>Believe it or not, but Eiji is--</b>

15:20.580 --> 15:21.420
<b>Cut!</b>

15:28.510 --> 15:30.130
<b>Those misplaced dots for eyes</b>

15:30.220 --> 15:33.180
<b>always pissed me off.</b>

15:33.600 --> 15:35.260
<b>Oh, Mrs.</b>

15:35.350 --> 15:38.980
<b>There's wrinkles on that
silky white bedsheet skin of yours.</b>

15:39.060 --> 15:42.520
<b>Good thing I am an expert at bed making.</b>

15:52.280 --> 15:53.370
<b>Look at that.</b>

15:56.160 --> 15:59.120
<b>You're almost at
the foot of the stairs to Heaven.</b>

16:01.170 --> 16:02.210
<b>No,</b>

16:02.290 --> 16:03.920
<b>it is Hell.</b>

16:05.500 --> 16:09.090
<b>It's a group tour to instant death!</b>

16:20.520 --> 16:21.890
<b>Okay, now.</b>

16:21.980 --> 16:24.610
<b>Let's make this fair play.</b>

16:26.020 --> 16:28.190
<b>Playtime is over.</b>

16:28.280 --> 16:30.490
<b>Today, in the most literal sense,</b>

16:31.110 --> 16:32.570
<b>you will be axed.</b>

16:34.160 --> 16:35.570
<b>Dine!</b>

16:37.200 --> 16:38.120
<b>Stop it!</b>

16:38.200 --> 16:40.000
<b>Very very good boy!</b>

16:41.290 --> 16:42.460
<b>Hitoris!</b>

16:43.830 --> 16:45.130
<b>Run away now.</b>

16:45.500 --> 16:46.840
<b>And fast.</b>

16:47.130 --> 16:49.630
<b>Her promise to spare one of you was a lie.</b>

16:49.710 --> 16:52.590
<b>She will leave no one
alive to tell her secret.</b>

16:52.670 --> 16:55.010
<b>Leave the village and get the police.</b>

16:57.140 --> 16:59.060
<b>And Eiji…</b>

16:59.140 --> 17:01.390
<b>Eiji is--</b>

17:11.900 --> 17:12.690
<b>Dali!</b>

17:12.780 --> 17:14.910
<b>We're far out of the village already.</b>

17:14.990 --> 17:16.700
<b>She won't chase us this far.</b>

17:16.780 --> 17:19.030
<b>No, not yet.</b>

17:19.120 --> 17:20.200
<b>Dali!</b>

17:20.290 --> 17:20.990
<b>Dali!</b>

17:21.870 --> 17:24.370
<b>How far are you gonna go?</b>

17:30.000 --> 17:31.210
<b>Hey, Dali.</b>

17:31.920 --> 17:34.380
<b>The old pair and… the beast…</b>

17:34.970 --> 17:36.760
<b>Do you think she…</b>

17:36.840 --> 17:37.970
<b>Killed them?</b>

17:38.050 --> 17:38.890
<b>No.</b>

17:39.430 --> 17:41.810
<b>We're the ones she's after.</b>

17:41.890 --> 17:43.480
<b>I'm sure they're fine.</b>

17:45.600 --> 17:47.150
<b>Maybe we should…</b>

17:47.230 --> 17:48.310
<b>We're not going back.</b>

17:49.400 --> 17:50.940
<b>If we do, she'll kill us.</b>

17:53.900 --> 17:55.150
<b>Forget everything.</b>

17:56.660 --> 17:58.410
<b>I know that…</b>

18:10.170 --> 18:11.920
<b>Dali, someone's here.</b>

18:12.000 --> 18:13.130
<b>It's okay, Migi.</b>

18:13.210 --> 18:14.720
<b>No one will find us in here.</b>

18:21.930 --> 18:23.560
<b><i>Huh? What is this?</i></b>

18:24.140 --> 18:26.020
<b><i>Some weird mix of leftovers?</i></b>

18:30.730 --> 18:32.480
<b>Migi, this is edible.</b>

18:35.490 --> 18:38.030
<b><i>But… Why would someone put this here?</i></b>

18:42.200 --> 18:43.450
<b><i>I got it.</i></b>

18:43.540 --> 18:44.450
<b><i>This place is</i></b>

18:44.540 --> 18:47.000
<b><i>A shrine for pointy-nosed beasts.</i></b>

18:47.080 --> 18:47.870
<b>Migi.</b>

18:47.960 --> 18:49.790
<b>Let's make this our new home.</b>

18:50.670 --> 18:52.670
<b>No one will find us here,</b>

18:52.750 --> 18:53.960
<b>and we have food too.</b>

18:58.630 --> 19:01.680
<b>I want the old lady's cherry pie.</b>

19:06.430 --> 19:07.310
<b>Dali?</b>

19:10.310 --> 19:11.810
<b>Dali!</b>

19:18.740 --> 19:19.700
<b>I told you.</b>

19:20.570 --> 19:22.660
<b>We can't go back to the Sonoyama house.</b>

19:29.670 --> 19:30.370
<b>Migi!</b>

19:30.710 --> 19:31.500
<b>You idiot!</b>

19:31.580 --> 19:32.330
<b>Get out of there!</b>

19:33.000 --> 19:34.000
<b>No.</b>

19:34.290 --> 19:35.750
<b>This bike is</b>

19:35.840 --> 19:37.510
<b>the first gift I've ever gotten.</b>

19:47.100 --> 19:49.230
<b>So the Sonoyamas are more important</b>

19:49.310 --> 19:51.190
<b>than me or your mother?</b>

19:51.270 --> 19:52.480
<b>You traitor!</b>

19:55.570 --> 19:57.320
<b>You're the traitor.</b>

19:57.690 --> 20:00.150
<b>Deciding to die all by yourself!</b>

20:01.990 --> 20:03.030
<b>Akiyama!</b>

20:03.530 --> 20:06.540
<b>All of a sudden you're
opening up to someone other than me!</b>

20:07.200 --> 20:08.290
<b>Sali!</b>

20:09.080 --> 20:11.170
<b>You took away my first love!</b>

20:11.250 --> 20:12.620
<b>I really loved her!</b>

20:16.670 --> 20:17.960
<b>How about it, Migi?</b>

20:18.050 --> 20:20.380
<b>Are you still
thinking about that cherry pie?</b>

20:26.180 --> 20:28.220
<b>We'll reveal…</b>

20:28.310 --> 20:30.480
<b>the truth about the Ichijos…</b>

20:32.390 --> 20:34.270
<b>and go for walks with…</b>

20:34.350 --> 20:35.730
<b>the golden beast--</b>

20:36.440 --> 20:37.190
<b>Quit that!</b>

20:39.110 --> 20:41.490
<b>We'll go catch bugs with Akiyama…</b>

20:41.570 --> 20:42.280
<b>Shut up.</b>

20:42.360 --> 20:44.410
<b>Shut up. Stop talking!</b>

20:45.200 --> 20:46.700
<b>And with the old woman…</b>

20:47.160 --> 20:48.120
<b>and the old man…</b>

20:48.200 --> 20:49.620
<b>and the two of us…</b>

20:52.160 --> 20:54.250
<b>We will have cherry pie together.</b>

20:59.880 --> 21:00.920
<b>That's…</b>

21:01.010 --> 21:02.010
<b>what you want?</b>

21:02.510 --> 21:03.220
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:03.300 --> 21:04.590
<b>Sounds good, right?</b>

21:09.720 --> 21:11.430
<b>You really are an idiot.</b>

21:11.520 --> 21:13.520
<b>You'll risk your life</b>

21:13.600 --> 21:16.810
<b>not to avenge our mother,
but for a sweet cherry pie?</b>

21:18.020 --> 21:20.690
<b>Ugh, my hands hurt.
I think I broke something.</b>

21:24.320 --> 21:25.610
<b>You'll have to</b>

21:25.700 --> 21:27.070
<b>hold the handles.</b>

21:27.570 --> 21:28.580
<b>Huh?</b>

21:38.170 --> 21:39.880
<b>Don't let your guard down, Migi.</b>

21:40.210 --> 21:42.590
<b>I know that, Dali.</b>

21:46.340 --> 21:50.010
<b>THANKS FOR THE FOOD</b>

23:25.610 --> 23:28.450
<b>Hitori didn't do it!</b>
